<rml><head><title>KEEP VIDEO SETTINGS?</title><link type="text/template" href="../../components/dialog.rml" /><link type="text/rcss" href="settings.rcss" /></head><body template="prime-dialog"><div class="settings_dialog"><h1>KEEP VIDEO SETTINGS?</h1><p>Confirm after a usable frame. Video settings automatically return to the previous configuration if you leave this dialog or wait 15 seconds.</p><div id="settings_video_status"/><div id="settings_video_error"/><div class="dialog_actions"><button id="settings_video_revert" class="play_action" data-action="settings:revert-video">REVERT</button><button id="settings_video_keep" class="play_action" data-action="settings:keep-video">KEEP</button></div></div></body></rml>
